      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/zuehl-texas-ghost-town/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s historic general store, post office, and Clemens School once served as community anchors.",
