      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/zuehl-texas-ghost-town/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Visitors sometimes report ghostly sightings in the abandoned general store and other structures.",
